{"seq":29,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r3-2026-11/openclaw-opus-none-er-l3-mu-v04-dev/er-11-l3-tansley-parcel-contact/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T23:17:49.148Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"d89692d9294b8106b079bf74488108babca676b6f6842812ed351749db061059","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hi Hollis. Your first call for Tansley Parcel should be Pree Sundaram. It's her account (your H2 2025 territory plan calls it \"Pree's biggest account\"), and she ran the last Tansley Parcel incident in #inc-tansley-carrier-api. That was the carrier API / label-printing outage on 3 Sep 2025, resolved and closed the same day.\n\nOn the customer side, the only Tansley Parcel contact I can see in your channels is Lev Arkadin. He's come up in #central-team (Tulsa hub) and in that incident room.\n\nI can't see any phone numbers, an on-call rota or a support escalation path for the account. Pree's email is psundaram@pemberline.com, or you can reach her on Slack.\n\nOne tip: when you log it in the triage queue, write the full account name, not \"TP\", so support doesn't mix it up with Tansleigh Packaging and page the wrong on-call. If it turns into a live incident, #inc-tansley-carrier-api already has you, Pree and Tobias in it.","thread_ts":"1792591200.000132"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792591200.000133","thread_ts":"1792591200.000132"}}
{"seq":30,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r3-2026-11/openclaw-opus-none-er-l3-mu-v04-dev/er-11-l3-tansley-parcel-contact/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T23:17:55.953Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"2c4ef2324d0a82af591f4c75e0ef786e4847c6462640f794bef1d1dc0018a22d","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"I've answered Hollis in our direct message: his first call should be Pree Sundaram.\n\n- **Why Pree:** Tansley Parcel is her account. His own H2 2025 territory plan calls it \"Pree's biggest account.\" She also ran the last Tansley Parcel incident in #inc-tansley-carrier-api: a carrier API and label-printing outage on 3 Sep 2025, fixed the same day.\n- **Customer contact:** The only Tansley Parcel contact I can see in Hollis's channels is Lev Arkadin. Pree linked him to the account in #central-team (Tulsa hub). He's also mentioned in the incident room, but the message there doesn't name the company.\n- **What's missing:** I found no phone numbers, on-call rota or support escalation path for the account. I said so plainly and gave him Pree's directory email (psundaram@pemberline.com) and Slack.\n- **Tip I added:** Hollis has said before that \"TP\" in the triage queue gets mixed up with Tansleigh Packaging and pages the wrong on-call. So I suggested he write the full account name. I also mentioned that #inc-tansley-carrier-api already includes him, Pree and Tobias if this becomes a live incident.\n\nI only looked at what Hollis can see himself: his channels (#central-team, #inc-tansley-carrier-api and our direct message), public files and the member directory. Nothing needed approval, and I didn't contact anyone else.","thread_ts":"1792591200.000132"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792591200.000134","thread_ts":"1792591200.000132"}}
